{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent non-author per-block review receipt for merged Gerrit change 3072, revision 10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be. All 45 rows PASS for exact before/final prose, contract accuracy, word reduction, scope, directives, and runtime AST. The 21 reviewed paths are byte-identical to the independently reviewed patchset despite Gerrit's merge rebase.\n\n```tsv\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_fail_loud_comment_errors.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_fail_loud_comment_errors.py#D:<module>\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_fail_loud_comment_errors.py#D:<module>\tComment failures become per-mutation errors even when other comments land. Total comment or label no-ops also trigger the same-kind canary.\t221\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_fail_loud_comment_errors.py\tD:test_create_path_comment_drop_promotes_to_error\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_fail_loud_comment_errors.py#D:test_create_path_comment_drop_promotes_to_error\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_fail_loud_comment_errors.py#D:test_create_path_comment_drop_promotes_to_error\tAn outbound create records a swallowed comment failure as an outcome error; create has no total-no-op canary.\t43\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_fail_loud_exit_and_preflight.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_fail_loud_exit_and_preflight.py#D:<module>\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_fail_loud_exit_and_preflight.py#D:<module>\tA pass exits nonzero when mutations recorded real failures, but stays zero when clean or a benign comment fallback applied. Unmapped status preflight warns without aborting the remaining batch.\t117\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_handler_404_isolation.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_handler_404_isolation.py#D:<module>\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_handler_404_isolation.py#D:<module>\tA Jira 404 on create, update, or delete is a per-mutation failure; later mutations still run. Other HTTP failures remain pass-fatal.\t202\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_handler_404_isolation.py\tD:test_404_on_create_or_delete_is_isolated_and_batch_continues\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_handler_404_isolation.py#D:test_404_on_create_or_delete_is_isolated_and_batch_continues\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_handler_404_isolation.py#D:test_404_on_create_or_delete_is_isolated_and_batch_continues\tCreate and delete 404s record isolated failures and permit the next mutation to run, matching update.\t59\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_handler_404_isolation.py\tD:test_non_404_http_error_still_propagates\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_handler_404_isolation.py#D:test_non_404_http_error_still_propagates\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_handler_404_isolation.py#D:test_non_404_http_error_still_propagates\tOnly 404 is isolated; other HTTP errors propagate so outages remain visible.\t44\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:<module>\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:<module>\tStructurally impossible inbound links are tried once, recorded durably, and skipped on unchanged passes. Changed graph evidence requalifies them; transient failures keep retrying, and the record is committed across checkouts.\t161\t30\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:store\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:store\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:store\tUse a real store with a closed source so link creation returns the structural closed-source verdict.\t43\t16\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:test_a_comment_on_an_endpoint_does_not_requalify_the_link\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_a_comment_on_an_endpoint_does_not_requalify_the_link\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_a_comment_on_an_endpoint_does_not_requalify_the_link\tAn endpoint comment is not structural evidence and must not cause another link attempt.\t36\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:test_a_cycle_record_is_invalidated_by_a_change_to_a_THIRD_ticket\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_a_cycle_record_is_invalidated_by_a_change_to_a_THIRD_ticket\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_a_cycle_record_is_invalidated_by_a_change_to_a_THIRD_ticket\tA cycle can disappear when an intermediate ticket changes, so the graph fingerprint must include more than the endpoints.\t78\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:test_a_status_change_on_an_ANCESTOR_invalidates_the_record\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_a_status_change_on_an_ANCESTOR_invalidates_the_record\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_a_status_change_on_an_ANCESTOR_invalidates_the_record\tPromotion may redirect a link to an ancestor; reopening that ancestor must invalidate the refusal.\t65\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:test_a_transient_failure_is_never_recorded_and_is_retried\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_a_transient_failure_is_never_recorded_and_is_retried\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_a_transient_failure_is_never_recorded_and_is_retried\tAn unclassified transient failure remains absent from the permanent store and is attempted again.\t44\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:test_classify_refuses_anything_not_provably_structural\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_classify_refuses_anything_not_provably_structural\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_classify_refuses_anything_not_provably_structural\tClassify only exact structural refusals; an unrelated error containing “is closed” must remain retryable.\t42\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:test_first_impossible_link_warns_and_the_repeat_skip_does_not\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_first_impossible_link_warns_and_the_repeat_skip_does_not\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_first_impossible_link_warns_and_the_repeat_skip_does_not\tWarn on the first structural refusal, then skip it quietly on unchanged passes.\t43\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:test_impossible_link_is_attempted_once_then_never_again\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_impossible_link_is_attempted_once_then_never_again\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_impossible_link_is_attempted_once_then_never_again\tCount actual link attempts: an unchanged structural refusal is attempted on pass 1 and skipped on pass 2.\t37\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:test_reopening_the_source_requalifies_the_link\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_reopening_the_source_requalifies_the_link\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_reopening_the_source_requalifies_the_link\tReopening the source changes the deciding graph evidence, so the link is retried and lands.\t47\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:test_the_record_file_is_staged_for_commit_back\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_the_record_file_is_staged_for_commit_back\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_the_record_file_is_staged_for_commit_back\tStage the refusal sidecar for commit-back so the next tickets-branch checkout retains the skip.\t66\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py\tD:test_the_skip_is_recorded_durably_and_survives_a_fresh_store\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_the_skip_is_recorded_durably_and_survives_a_fresh_store\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_impossible_links_cicada.py#D:test_the_skip_is_recorded_durably_and_survives_a_fresh_store\tPersist the structural refusal so a fresh pass sees the skip and an operator can inspect it.\t44\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_backfill.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_backfill.py#D:<module>\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_backfill.py#D:<module>\tOn first upgrade, backfill managed links only when the evidence file is absent. Never overwrite proven evidence; snapshot observations upgrade assumptions, and one shared store preserves both writes.\t188\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_backfill.py\tD:test_backfill_never_overwrites_proven_evidence\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_backfill.py#D:test_backfill_never_overwrites_proven_evidence\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_backfill.py#D:test_backfill_never_overwrites_proven_evidence\tBackfill skips existing confirmations so vendor link IDs and original confirming passes are retained.\t34\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_backfill.py\tD:test_lost_update_backfill_and_snapshot_records_both_survive\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_backfill.py#D:test_lost_update_backfill_and_snapshot_records_both_survive\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_backfill.py#D:test_lost_update_backfill_and_snapshot_records_both_survive\tBackfill and snapshot confirmation share one store; both different links survive its single save.\t44\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py#D:<module>\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py#D:<module>\tConfirm links only from authoritative snapshots: absent issuelinks is unobserved, an empty list is observed absence, and present links provide evidence. Preserve direction, idempotence, fail-open persistence, and no sidecar rewrite on unchanged passes.\t184\t33\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py\tD:test_authoritative_empty_confirms_nothing_and_unconfirms_nothing\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py#D:test_authoritative_empty_confirms_nothing_and_unconfirms_nothing\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py#D:test_authoritative_empty_confirms_nothing_and_unconfirms_nothing\tAn observed empty issuelinks list confirms nothing and does not retract earlier evidence.\t55\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_grou