irmations_snapshot.py#D:test_reconfirmation_is_idempotent_and_does_not_rewrite\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py#D:test_reconfirmation_is_idempotent_and_does_not_rewrite\tReobserving the same link preserves its first confirmation and leaves the store clean.\t35\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py\tD:test_two_passes_over_unchanged_snapshot_do_not_rewrite_the_sidecar\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py#D:test_two_passes_over_unchanged_snapshot_do_not_rewrite_the_sidecar\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py#D:test_two_passes_over_unchanged_snapshot_do_not_rewrite_the_sidecar\tTwo complete passes over the same authoritative links leave the sidecar unchanged.\t68\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py\tD:test_unobserved_issue_confirms_nothing\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py#D:test_unobserved_issue_confirms_nothing\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_snapshot.py#D:test_unobserved_issue_confirms_nothing\tAn absent issuelinks key is an incomplete observation and must confirm nothing.\t38\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_store.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_store.py#D:<module>\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_store.py#D:<module>\tPeer-confirmation evidence distinguishes links observed on the peer from locally managed refs. Keys include relation and ordered endpoints;