mations_store.py#D:test_store_survives_snapshot_compaction_of_the_ticket_log\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_peer_confirmations_store.py#D:test_store_survives_snapshot_compaction_of_the_ticket_log\tThe confirmation sidecar remains intact when ticket-log events are compacted into a snapshot.\t64\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_sync_only_scalar_update_dispatch_heldout.py\tC:34-37\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_sync_only_scalar_update_dispatch_heldout.py#C:34-37\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_sync_only_scalar_update_dispatch_heldout.py#C:20-20\tsubprocess_env keeps child values while redacting secrets from failure tracebacks.\t42\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_sync_only_scalar_update_dispatch_heldout.py\tC:39-42\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_sync_only_scalar_update_dispatch_heldout.py#C:39-42\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_sync_only_scalar_update_dispatch_heldout.py#C:22-22\tRemove inherited fixture sandbox paths so the probe reads its own seeded store.\t45\t13\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_sync_only_scalar_update_dispatch_heldout.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_sync_only_scalar_update_dispatch_heldout.py#D:<module>\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_sync_only_scalar_update_dispatch_heldout.py#D:<module>\tA live sync --only selection must dispatch a bound issue’s scalar update, matching legacy --filter-local-ids. The planner must recognize both selected local ID and bound Jira key; subprocess setup strips inherited sandbox overrides and protects secret values.\t160\t38\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:<module>\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:<module>\tAdvance scalar baselines only for writes confirmed by the transport. Successful values use the vendor payload; soft-failed transitions, comment fallback, stale bindings, parent-only edits, and handler failures report no synced fields.\t184\t31\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py\tD:test_a_400_illegal_transition_comment_fallback_reports_nothing\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:test_a_400_illegal_transition_comment_fallback_reports_nothing\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:test_a_400_illegal_transition_comment_fallback_reports_nothing\tA 400 transition fallback posts a comment rather than a field edit, so it reports no synced fields.\t48\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py\tD:test_a_completed_write_reports_every_field_it_sent\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:test_a_completed_write_reports_every_field_it_sent\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:test_a_completed_write_reports_every_field_it_sent\tA completed update reports every vendor-shaped scalar field sent to Jira for baseline advancement.\t56\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py\tD:test_a_parent_only_mutation_reports_nothing\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:test_a_parent_only_mutation_reports_nothing\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:test_a_parent_only_mutation_reports_nothing\tA parent-only mutation skips scalar update_issue and therefore reports no synced fields.\t39\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py\tD:test_an_unreachable_transition_reports_nothing\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:test_an_unreachable_transition_reports_nothing\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:test_an_unreachable_transition_reports_nothing\tA bare RuntimeError for an unreachable transition soft-fails the mutation and reports no synced fields.\t54\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py\tD:test_the_handler_records_nothing_for_a_soft_failed_mutation\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:test_the_handler_records_nothing_for_a_soft_failed_mutation\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_synced_fields_reporting_e6e9.py#D:test_the_handler_records_nothing_for_a_soft_failed_mutation\tThe handler records no local-ID-keyed scalar baseline for a soft-failed mutation.\t57\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_transition_error_soft_fail.py\tD:<module>\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_transition_error_soft_fail.py#D:<module>\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_transition_error_soft_fail.py#D:<module>\tA bare RuntimeError from an unreachable Jira transition is isolated per mutation. The batch continues and records the precise failure instead of aborting later writes.\t164\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\ntests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_transition_error_soft_fail.py\tD:test_transition_runtime_error_soft_fails_batch_continues\tba24f8734c922c9867645f20df35349bed885419:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_transition_error_soft_fail.py#D:test_transition_runtime_error_soft_fails_batch_continues\t10a91af197f9b1016382f08d4f77b4e477c386be:tests/unit/reconciler/apply/test_transition_error_soft_fail.py#D:test_transition_runtime_error_soft_fails_batch_continues\tIn a good/bad/good batch, record the transition error on the bad mutation and still attempt both good writes.\t44\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group02:2026-10-23\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792748633960520000,"uuid":"ff12830f-a450-4616-bdf0-ce0c7c7fa95d"}